    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n301" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăcapnos</span></b> , on,
		adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκαπνος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>without smoke</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ligna acapna,</span>”
				<i>wood so dry as to emit no smoke in burning</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					13, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mel acapnon,</span>”
				<i>honey obtained without driving away the bees by
					smoke</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					6, 33, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 11, 16, 15, §
		45</span></i>.</div>
